      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know people say \"you matter\" but it's just something people say to feel better about themselves. if i just stopped existing, the function of the city wouldn't change. nothing would break. there's something almost peaceful about the idea that it's okay to just fade out. like, if the universe is this big and uncaring, why is it so wrong to just choose to be part of the silence?",
